        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "Nope - from the Repeat section:\n<blockquote>\n&quot;If a Repeat specifies where to use it, obey those instructions (instead of the normal Range and Target restrictions).&quot;\n</blockquote>\nand Insatiable Hunger of the Swarm explicitly says &quot;an adjacent land&quot;. (Thematically, the swarm is moving.) So you ignore normal Range/Targeting.\n\nBut if it were [s]The Land Thrashes In Furious Pain[/s]Winds of Rust and Atrophy, which simply says &quot;<strong>Repeat</strong> this Power&quot;, then you&#39;d choose your target again from scratch and could choose to use Shadows of the Dahan - no need to &nbsp;pay Energy; Shadows of the Dahan is a modification to the Power (specifically, its Range), which is kept when the Power is Repeated. \n\n&nbsp;\n",
